<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 803)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The manual is current across all three books</b> (Help &#9656; Asobi Manual). New: the grayscale interface, the web page&#8217;s wayfinding and its phone interface, camera raw on every door, and the anamorphic desqueeze and clip info panels in the Reviewer Guide and Getting Started. Corrected: side-by-side and stacked compares size each side on its own (the manual still described half-size frames), the side-by-side movie export matches what you see, and <b>V</b> is a voice-note toggle in the app (hold-to-talk is the web page).</li>
<li>The cheat sheet (<b>H</b>) lists <b>&#8997;&#8984;G</b> Grayscale interface, and the shortcut chapter gained the &#8984;I, &#8679;&#8984;R and &#8997;&#8984;R rows it was missing.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
